n speed.\n\nC: quick correct decisions, attention skills, concern for others, but communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education. Concern for others good for teamwork, but egocentric contradictory. Education lack may affect long-term suitability.\n\nD: responds adequately to unexpected events, concentration, problem solving, responsibility - good for pressure, decision, reliability. Weakness: moody, loner (teamwork). No info on stress handling.\n\nWe need provisional preference. Which candidate seems best overall? B has stress handling, conscientiousness, weather assessment (critical), computer skills (modern avionics). Communication tone issues but maybe manageable. A has leadership and anticipation but unfriendly. D has responsibility and problem solving but moody/loner. C has quick decisions but communication issues and lack of education.\n\nProbably B is strongest overall, despite communication tone. So provisional preference B, with uncertainty due to communication style and pretentiousness possibly affecting crew cooperation. Need more info on teamwork, leadership, decision speed for B, also about A's stress handling, D's mood impact, C's egocentric.\n\nThus we state vote B.\n\nNow produce output."}
